build\",\"sessionId\":\"d910793e-44d5-4b76-a978-fb98052552f1\",\"version\":\"2.1.87\",\"gitBranch\":\"stable\",\"slug\":\"proud-popping-falcon\"}\n{\"parentUuid\":\"eb733985-8819-4d64-a3a5-8bdc095eb9e3\",\"isSidechain\":true,\"agentId\":\"a5d384807705efc78\",\"message\":{\"id\":\"061d363119c776f0892624a0ca3474d6\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Good - `process.hh` is already included. Now let me fix `BareMetalWorkload::initState()`.\\n\"}],\"model\":\"MiniMax-M2.7\",\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":218,\"output_tokens\":0,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":577,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":82421},\"service_tier\":\"standard\"},\"type\":\"assistant\",\"uuid\":\"bc2c1cb9-422f-40cb-aba7-7211e264d3b6\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-04-02T05:48:36.833Z\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"cli\",\"cwd\":\"/Users/wangxu/1-project/sdc-fuzzing/qemu/build\",\"sessionId\":\"d910793e-44d5-4b76-a978-fb98052552f1\",\"version\":\"2.1.87\",\"gitBranch\":\"stable\",\"slug\":\"proud-popping-falcon\"}\n</output>"}]},"uuid":"298f7fc6-acde-49b6-8f4a-bad7a4f0b39b","timestamp":"2026-04-02T05:48:38.920Z","toolUseResult":{"retrieval_status":"not_ready","task":{"task_id":"a5d384807705efc78","task_type":"local_agent","status":"running","description":"Fix gem5 decoder patterns","output":"{\"parentUuid\":null,\"isSidechain\":true,\"promptId\":\"520da623-e17e-4efe-b292-47222de157e3\",\"agentId\":\"a5d384807705efc78\",\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"FIX GEM5 DECODER: 修复 gem5 ARM64 指令解码器问题\\n\\n## 问题描述\\ngem5 SE 模式下，某些ARM64指令（如FMADD, FMLA, FMOV等）无法被正确解码，返回 \\\"GEM5_UNKNOWN_INST\\\" 错误。\\n\\n## 根因分析\\n在 `gem5/src/arch/arm/isa/formats/aarch64.isa` 中:\\n\\n1. **FMOV (0x1e204020)** 解码失败:\\n   - `isFpDataProc1Source` pattern 要求 bit[18]=1\\n   - 但 FMOV 的 bit[18]=0, 属于 \\\"FP Misc\\\" 指令\\n   \\n2. **FMADD/FMLA 等指令** 未被正确路由到 `decodeFpDataProc`\\n\\n## 修复任务\\n1. 分析 aarch64.isa 中的 pattern matcher 和 decode function 路由\\n2. 修复 isFpDataProc1Source 或添加新的 pattern 来匹配 FMOV\\n3. 确保 FMADD, FMLA 等指令能正确路由\\n4. 重新编译 gem5 (如果需要)\\n\\n## 关键文件\\n- gem5/src/arch/arm/isa/formats/aarch64.isa (decoder patterns)\\n- gem5/src/arch/arm/isa/formats/neon64.isa (NEON decode functions)\\n\\n## 验证\\n修复后运行测试:\\n```bash\\ncd /Users/wangxu/1-project/sdc-fuzzing/gem5\\n./build/ARM/gem5.opt configs/example/arm/sdc_baremetal_se.py /Users/wangxu/1-project/sdc-fuzzing/test_simple.elf\\n```\\n\\n需要看到正常退出而不是 \\\"unknown instruction\\\" 错误。\"},\"uuid\":\"f320cf06-6ac0-47b0-b553-388a72b6c345\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-04-02T02:25:42.707Z\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"cli\",\"cwd\":\"/Users/wangxu/1-project/sdc-fuzzing/gem5\",\"sessionId\":\"d910793e-44d5-4b76-a978-fb98052552f1\",\"version\":\"2.1.87\",\"gitBranch\":\"stable\",\"slug\":\"proud-popping-falcon\"}\n{\"parentUuid\":\"c7b92c82-5641-46cf-96db-e688bc7d424a\",\"isSidechain\":true,\"agentId\":\"a5d384807705efc78\",\"message\":{\"id\":\"061d06a77637952c9efe176644dfd184\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"The user wants me to fix gem5 ARM64 instruction decoder issues. Let me start by exploring the relevant files to understand the problem.\",\"signature\":\"0da406f9716cd7aa02a186ac4892aa1d5cabb9ec751d9083e93e49f2346d5702\"}],\"model\":\"MiniMax-M2.7\",\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":287,\"output_tokens\":0,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":29020,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":0},\"service_tier\":\"standard\"},\"type\":\"assistant\",\"uuid\":\"33cb8498-c0ca-4f03-b6b9-dbca99d1a59c\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-04-02T02:25:52.338Z\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"cli\",\"cwd\":\"/Users/wangxu/1-project/sdc-fuzzing/gem5\",\"sessionId\":\"d910793e-44d5-4b76-a978-fb98052552f1\",\"version\":\"2.1.87\",\"gitBranch\":\"stable\",\"slug\":\"proud-popping-falcon\"}\n{\"parentUuid\":\"33cb8498-c0ca-4f03-b6b9-dbca99d1a59c\",\"isSidechai