opping-falcon\"}\n{\"parentUuid\":\"1ed6898b-ae6e-4849-85c6-ad3497f104e4\",\"isSidechain\":true,\"promptId\":\"520da623-e17e-4efe-b292-47222de157e3\",\"agentId\":\"a5d384807705efc78\",\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"tool_use_id\":\"call_function_vj39nd1pafox_1\",\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"content\":\"47://Include the C++ include directives\\n48:##include \\\"includes.isa\\\"\\n57:##include \\\"arminstobjparams.isa\\\"\\n60:##include \\\"bitfields.isa\\\"\\n63:##include \\\"operands.isa\\\"\\n66:##include \\\"templates/templates.isa\\\"\\n69:##include \\\"insts/insts.isa\\\"\\n72:##include \\\"formats/formats.isa\\\"\\n75:##include \\\"decoder/decoder.isa\\\"\",\"is_error\":false}]},\"uuid\":\"4ee5d5a9-ce7d-46ef-b204-9cd31ffa23a7\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-04-02T04:26:41.257Z\",\"sourceToolAssistantUUID\":\"1ed6898b-ae6e-4849-85c6-ad3497f104e4\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"cli\",\"cwd\":\"/Users/wangxu/1-project/sdc-fuzzing/gem5\",\"sessionId\":\"d910793e-44d5-4b76-a978-fb98052552f1\",\"version\":\"2.1.87\",\"gitBranch\":\"stable\",\"slug\":\"proud-popping-falcon\"}\n{\"parentUuid\":\"4ee5d5a9-ce7d-46ef-b204-9cd31ffa23a7\",\"isSidechain\":true,\"agentId\":\"a5d384807705efc78\",\"message\":{\"id\":\"061d2301130aa487f7743d75f83e74d0\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"OK so `main.isa` includes `formats/formats.isa` which in turn includes `formats/aarch64.isa`. And the ISA compiler generates the .cc and .hh files from these.\\n\\nThe decoder files are included in the generated decoder.cc:\\n```cpp\\n#include \\\"base/compiler.hh\\\"\\n#include \\\"decoder-g.cc.inc\\\"\\n#include \\\"decoder.hh\\\"\\n#include \\\"decode-method.cc.inc\\\"\\n```\\n\\nWait, looking at the generated decoder.cc:\\n```cpp\\n#include \\\"base/compiler.hh\\\"\\n#include \\\"decoder-g.cc.inc\\\"\\n#include \\\"decoder.hh\\\"\\n#include \\\"decode-method.cc.inc\\\"\\n\\n\\n```\\n\\n`decoder-ns.