is actually 64-bit, or if there's something else going on with how the bitfield operations are being compiled. Let me trace through the template instantiation more carefully to see what's actually happening.\",\"signature\":\"a6983c308313cc6779219efa5957a2126390b5b80635ece9040190d1bb0065e5\"}],\"model\":\"MiniMax-M2.7\",\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":287,\"output_tokens\":0,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":545,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":121376},\"service_tier\":\"standard\"},\"type\":\"assistant\",\"uuid\":\"09704a82-7534-40b9-9bf7-354cf40ca5d2\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-04-02T04:36:28.762Z\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"cli\",\"cwd\":\"/Users/wangxu/1-project/sdc-fuzzing/qemu/build\",\"sessionId\":\"d910793e-44d5-4b76-a978-fb98052552f1\",\"version\":\"2.1.87\",\"gitBranch\":\"stable\",\"slug\":\"proud-popping-falcon\"}\n{\"parentUuid\":\"09704a82-7534-40b9-9bf7-354cf40ca5d2\",\"isSidechain\":true,\"agentId\":\"a5d384807705efc78\",\"message\":{\"id\":\"061d253a7ecb42d80296f883e67f2a3c\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"`ExtMachInst` is 64-bit! Let me check the `BitUnion64` definition:\\n\"}],\"model\":\"MiniMax-M2.7\",\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":287,\"output_tokens\":0,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":545,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":121376},\"service_tier\":\"standard\"},\"type\":\"assistant\",\"uuid\":\"40d02de6-3a11-4ef3-a482-f4576b3fda29\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-04-02T04:36:29.269Z\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"cli\",\"cwd\":\"/Users/wangxu/1-project/sdc-fuzzing/qemu/build\",\"sessionId\":\"d910793e-44d5-4b76-a978-fb98052552f1\",\"version\":\"2.1.87\",\"gitBranch\":\"stable\",\"slug\":\"proud-popping-falcon\"}\n{\"parentUuid\":\"40d02de6-3a11-4ef3-a482-f4576b3fda29\",\"isSidechain\":true,\"agentId\":\"a5d384807705efc78\",\"message\":{\"id\":\"061d253a7ecb42d80296f883e67f2a3c\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\