ion, then for FMLS (0x1e2e1000), COND_CODE == 0x1, NOT 0xf. \\n\\nNow I need to find where the COND_CODE switch actually ends and check if there's a default case. If there's no default case handling non-0xf values and the switch only has `case 0xf:`, then COND_CODE == 0x1 would fall through to the closing brace, which means it exits the switch block without returning anything. Looking at the depth changes at line 70 and beyond, I can trace when the switch depth of 7 drops back to 6 or lower.\",\"signature\":\"7e32f0f38a6e3837d0ca55b9967af30a239476873abe58bbd3b17a46de3e4b41\"}],\"model\":\"MiniMax-M2.7\",\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":218,\"output_tokens\":0,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":1741,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":61881},\"service_tier\":\"standard\"},\"type\":\"assistant\",\"uuid\":\"be56fdde-b5a4-404f-8e8b-1c6a35632e5f\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-04-02T05:42:57.685Z\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"cli\",\"cwd\":\"/Users/wangxu/1-project/sdc-fuzzing/qemu/build\",\"sessionId\":\"d910793e-44d5-4b76-a978-fb98052552f1\",\"version\":\"2.1.87\",\"gitBranch\":\"stable\",\"slug\":\"proud-popping-falcon\"}\n{\"parentUuid\":\"be56fdde-b5a4-404f-8e8b-1c6a35632e5f\",\"isSidechain\":true,\"agentId\":\"a5d384807705efc78\",\"message\":{\"id\":\"061d34d25f16d27f86ff132f3dc5ab02\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Let me find where the COND_CODE switch closes and if there's a default case.\\n\"}],\"model\":\"MiniMax-M2.7\",\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":218,\"output_tokens\":0,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":1741,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":61881},\"service_tier\":\"standard\"},\"type\":\"assistant\",\"uuid\":\"d71d6a9b-7929-4241-bd06-dbe847180519\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-04-02T05:42:58.402Z\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"cli\",\"cwd\":\"/Users/wangxu/1-project/sdc-fuzzing/qemu/build\",\"sessionId\":\"d910793e-44d5-4b76-a9