tput isn't appearing.\\n\\nLooking at the timestamps, the binary was rebuilt at 13:13, which is after I edited the generated file at 13:08. Yet the binary doesn't contain my debug string. This could mean the edit to `decode-method.cc.inc` was somehow reverted or the scons build regenerated it from the source `.isa` files, overwriting my changes. I need to verify whether my edit to the generated file actually persisted or if it got overwritten by the build process.\",\"signature\":\"30530bd13c1462ad4f651b827046ce0c8b25d051f3f3639d8a7b40588d51298c\"}],\"model\":\"MiniMax-M2.7\",\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":218,\"output_tokens\":0,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":266,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":146833},\"service_tier\":\"standard\"},\"type\":\"assistant\",\"uuid\":\"2c395f03-0d73-4872-95f9-a0901dacb0e6\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-04-02T05:16:09.290Z\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"cli\",\"cwd\":\"/Users/wangxu/1-project/sdc-fuzzing/qemu/build\",\"sessionId\":\"d910793e-44d5-4b76-a978-fb98052552f1\",\"version\":\"2.1.87\",\"gitBranch\":\"stable\",\"slug\":\"proud-popping-falcon\"}\n{\"parentUuid\":\"2c395f03-0d73-4872-95f9-a0901dacb0e6\",\"isSidechain\":true,\"agentId\":\"a5d384807705efc78\",\"message\":{\"id\":\"061d2e8c247c3b2a748d272b2f2fdc10\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"id\":\"call_function_fbzegq9jj54x_1\",\"name\":\"Bash\",\"input\":{\"command\":\"grep \\\"DBG decodeInst\\\" /Users/wangxu/1-project/sdc-fuzzing/gem5/build/ARM/arch/arm/generated/decode-method.cc.inc\"}}],\"model\":\"MiniMax-M2.7\",\"stop_reason\":\"tool_use\",\"stop_sequence\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":218,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":266,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":146833,\"output_tokens\":391,\"server_tool_use\":{\"web_search_requests\":0,\"web_fetch_requests\":0},\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0},\"infer