ern matcher `isFpMulMadd` that captures both instructions and route them to `decodeFpMulMadd`. I need to check whether that decode function already exists in neon64.isa or if I need to implement it.\",\"signature\":\"9772abd155b0013566b5527b58785826283b21d7ee285cbb6182e40339c7f560\"}],\"model\":\"MiniMax-M2.7\",\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":0,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":0,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":79241},\"service_tier\":\"standard\"},\"type\":\"assistant\",\"uuid\":\"fc8bab9c-165b-4264-8c28-67da28a1faf6\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-04-02T02:42:27.916Z\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"cli\",\"cwd\":\"/Users/wangxu/1-project/sdc-fuzzing/gem5\",\"sessionId\":\"d910793e-44d5-4b76-a978-fb98052552f1\",\"version\":\"2.1.87\",\"gitBranch\":\"stable\",\"slug\":\"proud-popping-falcon\"}\n{\"parentUuid\":\"fc8bab9c-165b-4264-8c28-67da28a1faf6\",\"isSidechain\":true,\"agentId\":\"a5d384807705efc78\",\"message\":{\"id\":\"061d0a855f9b485ec610bb647d468daa\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The fix needs two changes: (1) add guard to `decodeFpDataProc2Source`, and (2) add a new pattern `isFpMulMadd` to catch FMLA/FMLS before the FP path. Let me check if `decodeFpMulMadd` already exists in neon64.isa.\\n\"}],\"model\":\"MiniMax-M2.7\",\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":0,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":0,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":79241},\"service_tier\":\"standard\"},\"type\":\"assistant\",\"uuid\":\"b36acf59-ea9a-481f-ac3d-647317ed400f\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-04-02T02:42:29.216Z\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"cli\",\"cwd\":\"/Users/wangxu/1-project/sdc-fuzzing/gem5\",\"sessionId\":\"d910793e-44d5-4b76-a978-fb98052552f1\",\"version\":\"2.1.87\",\"gitBranch\":\"stable\",\"slug\":\"proud-popping-falcon\"}\n{\"parentUuid\":\"b36acf59-ea9a-481f-ac3d-647317ed400f\",\"isSidechain\":true,\"a