}')\\n\\\"\\n\",\"description\":\"Verify FMLA vs FMLS opcode distinction\"}}],\"model\":\"MiniMax-M2.7\",\"stop_reason\":\"tool_use\",\"stop_sequence\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":287,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":519,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":94632,\"output_tokens\":1472,\"server_tool_use\":{\"web_search_requests\":0,\"web_fetch_requests\":0},\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0},\"inference_geo\":\"\",\"iterations\":[],\"speed\":\"standard\"},\"service_tier\":\"standard\"},\"type\":\"assistant\",\"uuid\":\"cf5f0e2f-dc0b-4455-9a5f-394229081714\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-04-02T02:52:21.390Z\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"cli\",\"cwd\":\"/Users/wangxu/1-project/sdc-fuzzing/gem5\",\"sessionId\":\"d910793e-44d5-4b76-a978-fb98052552f1\",\"version\":\"2.1.87\",\"gitBranch\":\"stable\",\"slug\":\"proud-popping-falcon\"}\n{\"parentUuid\":\"cf5f0e2f-dc0b-4455-9a5f-394229081714\",\"isSidechain\":true,\"promptId\":\"520da623-e17e-4efe-b292-47222de157e3\",\"agentId\":\"a5d384807705efc78\",\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"tool_use_id\":\"call_function_1tq3uf88y1m9_1\",\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"content\":\"FMLA:  0x19 = 11001\\nFMLS:  0x1B = 11011\\nFMLA bit0=1, FMLS bit0=1\\n\\nFMLA vs FMLS distinction: opcode & 0x2?\\n0x19 & 0x2 = 0 (bit1 of opcode)\\n0x1B & 0x2 = 2\\nFMLA: opcode LSB = 1\\nFMLS: opcode LSB = 1\\n\\nCan we distinguish by opcode value directly?\\nFMLA opcode=0x19, FMLS opcode=0x1B\\nDifference: bit1 (0x19&1=1, 0x1B&1=1) - SAME\\nbit0: SAME\\n\\nFMLA: opcode bits14:10 = 11001 (bit1=0, bit0=1)\\nFMLS: opcode bits14:10 = 11011 (bit1=1, bit0=1)\\nFMLA bit1=0, FMLS bit1=1\",\"is_error\":false}]},\"uuid\":\"ad82b81b-4abd-4e2e-b54e-78d741f6338d\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-04-02T02:52:21.520Z\",\"sourceToolAssistantUUID\":\"cf5f0e2f-dc0b-4455-9a5f-394229081714\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"cli\",\"cwd\":\"/Users/wangxu/1-project/sdc