for the instruction encoding, and there's a critical mismatch: `encoding` spans bits 27-25, but I'm checking bit 28, which falls outside this range. In my pattern, character 3 should map to bit 28, yet the `encoding` field definition doesn't include that bit. I need to check whether there's another bitfield covering bit 28 or if there's a structural conflict in how these fields are defined.\",\"signature\":\"5a83221d1bc4004108adc4919f1bf22ab4ab5662584ce8ae4aae80e437942f1c\"}],\"model\":\"MiniMax-M2.7\",\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":0,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":0,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":126574},\"service_tier\":\"standard\"},\"type\":\"assistant\",\"uuid\":\"c075dc11-9d7f-43e4-b250-1aead3fad667\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-04-02T04:38:54.371Z\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"cli\",\"cwd\":\"/Users/wangxu/1-project/sdc-fuzzing/qemu/build\",\"sessionId\":\"d910793e-44d5-4b76-a978-fb98052552f1\",\"version\":\"2.1.87\",\"gitBranch\":\"stable\",\"slug\":\"proud-popping-falcon\"}\n{\"parentUuid\":\"c075dc11-9d7f-43e4-b250-1aead3fad667\",\"isSidechain\":true,\"agentId\":\"a5d384807705efc78\",\"message\":{\"id\":\"061d25cf4b8ead172b7e8c029be14644\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Let me look for what covers bits 31-28 in ExtMachInst:\\n\"}],\"model\":\"MiniMax-M2.7\",\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":0,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":0,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":126574},\"service_tier\":\"standard\"},\"type\":\"assistant\",\"uuid\":\"7e23ce8e-2d9d-444c-bb48-393ea7c9b090\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-04-02T04:38:54.893Z\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"cli\",\"cwd\":\"/Users/wangxu/1-project/sdc-fuzzing/qemu/build\",\"sessionId\":\"d910793e-44d5-4b76-a978-fb98052552f1\",\"version\":\"2.1.87\",\"gitBranch\":\"stable\",\"slug\":\"proud-popping-falcon\"}\n{\"parentUuid\":\"7e23ce8e-2d9d