elong to any statistics::Group. Legacy stat is deprecated.\\nRunning /Users/wangxu/1-project/sdc-fuzzing/test_neon.elf on atomic CPU (atomic mode)...\\ngem5 Simulator System.  https://www.gem5.org\\ngem5 is copyrighted software; use the --copyright option for details.\\n\\ngem5 version 25.1.0.0\\ngem5 compiled Apr  1 2026 16:17:27\\ngem5 started Apr  2 2026 10:35:02\\ngem5 executing on wangxudeMacBook-Air.local, pid 92404\\ncommand line: ./build/ARM/gem5.opt configs/example/arm/sdc_baremetal_se.py /Users/wangxu/1-project/sdc-fuzzing/test_neon.elf --max-ticks=1000000\\n\\ninfo: Standard input is not a terminal, disabling listeners.\\nsrc/arch/arm/faults.cc:785: panic: Attempted to execute unknown instruction (inst 0x1e2e1000)\\nMemory Usage: 409214368 KBytes\\nProgram aborted at tick 0\\n--- BEGIN LIBC BACKTRACE ---\\n0   gem5.opt                            0x0000000102209058 _ZN4gem515print_backtraceEv + 44\\n1   gem5.opt                            0x000000010221c7f0 _ZN4gem512abortHandlerEi + 68\\n2   libsystem_platform.dylib            0x0000000191e08624 _sigtramp + 56\\n3   libsystem_pthread.dylib             0x0000000191dce88c pthread_kill + 296\\n4   libsystem_c.dylib                   0x0000000191cd7c60 abort + 124\\n5   gem5.opt                            0x0000000100982b7c REDACTED + 0\\n6   gem5.opt                            0x0000000100dd95d8 REDACTED + 248\\n7   gem5.opt                            0x0000000100d0bf14 REDACTED + 184\\n8   gem5.opt                            0x0000000100cf75fc _ZN4gem515AtomicSimpleCPU4tickEv + 1316\\n9   gem5.opt                            0x00000001022152e0 _ZN4gem510EventQueue10serviceOneEv + 244\\n10  gem5.opt                            0x000000010222ebb4 _ZN4gem59doSimLoopEPNS_10EventQueueE + 280\\n11  gem5.opt                            0x000000010222e5bc _ZN4gem58simulateEy + 496\\n12  gem5.opt                            0x0000000100a171bc REDACTED + 88\\n13  gem5.opt                            0x0000000100a17158 RED