urce` check will reject FMLS before we even get to `isFpMulMadd`, so I need to remove that guard entirely and let the pattern matcher handle it. The `isFpConvFixedP` fix is already in place, so now it's just a matter of stripping out the guard and relying on the pattern matching logic instead.\",\"signature\":\"d2ac00ed4b9aa6f689cb34d83169d2bc6f66058d3b6fd13a8a95f6a1d4797fa9\"}],\"model\":\"MiniMax-M2.7\",\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":287,\"output_tokens\":0,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":218,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":145465},\"service_tier\":\"standard\"},\"type\":\"assistant\",\"uuid\":\"2a91b0b1-4ded-4d15-b566-d67dec60337b\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-04-02T03:24:36.851Z\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"cli\",\"cwd\":\"/Users/wangxu/1-project/sdc-fuzzing/gem5\",\"sessionId\":\"d910793e-44d5-4b76-a978-fb98052552f1\",\"version\":\"2.1.87\",\"gitBranch\":\"stable\",\"slug\":\"proud-popping-falcon\"}\n{\"parentUuid\":\"2a91b0b1-4ded-4d15-b566-d67dec60337b\",\"isSidechain\":true,\"agentId\":\"a5d384807705efc78\",\"message\":{\"id\":\"061d1466e281f3549642968b7587a040\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The `isFpDataProc2Source` guard fires BEFORE `isFpMulMadd` is even checked. The guard was added but `isFpMulMadd` comes AFTER `isFpDataProc2Source` in the if-chain. Since `isFpDataProc2Source` matches FMLS and returns Unknown, `isFpMulMadd` is never reached.\\n\\nI need to remove the guard and rely solely on `isFpMulMadd` being before `isFpDataProc2Source` in the router.\\n\"}],\"model\":\"MiniMax-M2.7\",\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":287,\"output_tokens\":0,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":218,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":145465},\"service_tier\":\"standard\"},\"type\":\"assistant\",\"uuid\":\"92dae8f9-3b58-4ddf-a4ad-33cce0006d95\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-04-02T03:24:39.683Z\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"cli\",\"cwd\":\"/Users/wangxu/1-project/sdc-fuzzing/gem5\",\"sessionId\":\"d910793e-44d5-4b76-a978-fb98052552f1\",\"version\":\"2.1.87\",\"gitBranch\":\"stable\",\"slug\":\"proud-popping-falcon\"}\n{\"parentUuid\":\"92dae8f9-3b58-4ddf-a4ad-33cce0006d95\",\"isSidechain\":true,\"agentId\":\"a5d384807705efc78\",\"message\":{\"id\":\"061d1466e281f3549642968b7587a040\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"id\":\"call_function_r5j0yyqpyft4_1\",\"name\":\"Edit\",\"input\":{\"replace_all\":false,\"file_path\":\"/Users/wangxu/1-project/sdc-fuzzing/gem5/src/arch/arm/isa/formats/aarch64.isa\",\"old_string\":\"    StaticInstPtr\\n    decodeFpDataProc2Source(ExtMachInst machInst)\\n    {\\n        if (bits(machInst, 31) ||\\n                bits(machInst, 29)) {\\n            return new Unknown64(machInst);\\n        }\\n\\n        // FMLA/FMLS (bit21=1, bit20=0, bit15=0) are reserved in scalar FP\\n        // space.  Reject them here so they fall through to the NEON decoder.\\n        if (bits(machInst, 21) && !bits(machInst, 20) && !bits(machInst, 15))\\n            return new Unknown64(machInst);\\n\\n        RegIndex rd = (RegIndex)(uint32_t)bits(machInst,  4,  0);\\n        RegIndex rn = (RegIndex)(uint32_t)bits(machInst,  9,  5);\\n        RegIndex rm = (RegIndex)(uint32_t)bits(machInst, 20, 16);\\n        uint8_t switchVal = (bits(machInst, 15, 12) << 0) |\\n                            (bits(machInst, 23, 22) << 4);\",\"new_string\":\"    StaticInstPtr\\n    decodeFpDataProc2Source(ExtMachInst machInst)\\n    {\\n        if (bits(machInst, 31) ||\\n                bits(machInst, 29)) {\\n            return new Unknown64(machInst);\\n        }\\n        RegIndex rd = (RegIndex)(uint32_t)bits(machInst,  4,  0);\\n        RegIndex rn = (RegIndex)(uint32_t)bits(machInst,  9,  5);\\n        RegIndex rm = (RegIndex)(uint32_t)bits(machInst, 20, 16);\\n        uint8_t switchVal = (bits(machInst, 15, 12) << 0) |\\n                            (bits(machInst, 23, 22) << 4);\"}}],\"model\":\"MiniMax-M2.7\",\"stop_reason\":\"tool_use\",\"stop_sequence\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":287,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":218,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":145465,\"output_tokens\":1066,\"server_tool_use\":{\"web_search_requests\":0,\"web_fetch_requests\":0},\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0},\"inference_geo\":\"\",\"iterations\":[],\"speed\":\"standard\"},\"service_tier\":\"standard\"},\"type\":\"assistant\",\"uuid\":\"a6cd30c6-94fb-4e05-aa77-9b0f16d66b00\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-04-02T03:24:48.016Z\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"cli\",\"cwd\":\"/Users/wangxu/1-project/sdc-fuzzing/gem5\",\"sessionId\":\"d910793e-44d5-4b76-a978-fb98052552f1\",\"version\":\"2.1.87\",\"gitBranch\":\"stable\",\"slug\":\"proud-popping-falcon\"}\n{\"parentUuid\":\"a6cd30c6-94fb-4e05-aa77-9b0f16d66b00\",\"isSidechain\":true,\"promptId\":\"520da623-e17e-4efe-b292-47222de157e3\",\"agentId\":\"a5d384807705efc78\",\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"tool_use_id\":\"call_function_r5j0yyqpyft4_1\",\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"content\":\"The file /Users/wangxu/1-project/sdc-fuzzing/gem5/src/arch/arm/isa/formats/aarch64.isa has been updated successfully.\"}]},\"uuid\":\"28562f94-dfee-4fbb-ba22-be10970732a9\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-04-02T03:24:48.155Z\",\"sourceToolAssistantUUID\":\"a6cd30c6-94fb-4e05-aa77-9b0f16d66b00\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"cli\",\"cwd\":\"/Users/wangxu/1-project/sdc-fuzzing/gem5\",\"sessionId\":\"d910793e-44d5-4b76-a978-fb98052552f1\",\"version\":\"2.1.87\",\"gitBranch\":\"stable\",\"slug\":\"proud-popping-falcon\"}\n{\"parentUuid\":\"28562f94-dfee-4fbb-ba22-be10970732a9\",\"isSidechain\":true,\"agentId\":\"a5d384807705efc78\",\"message\":{\"id\":\"061d1480aa7592d8e65f59d6c8182b36\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"Now rebuild and te