{"parentUuid":"43a24a0e-5276-4f73-8fb2-1255abcf1b58","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"061d3b034125a9ace31d1c63712a509b","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The gem5 changes have been committed and pushed. Now I need to:\n1. Continue fixing remaining gem5 issues (the exit problem)\n2. Generate 2000 test cases with Microprobe to verify instruction correctness\n\nLet me first check what gem5 issues remain and fix them. Then create a subagent to generate test cases.\n","signature":"0e23d3bf5404e34f4418fa30fa40c75ebb07ad79df8f04bc0140c2695d23bfd2"}],"model":"MiniMax-M2.5","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":145632,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0},"service_tier":"standard"},"type":"assistant","uuid":"9acff361-670b-4b4c-8d91-6c95c3356fdf","timestamp":"2026-04-02T06:09:28.745Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/wangxu/1-project/sdc-fuzzing/gem5","sessionId":"d910793e-44d5-4b76-a978-fb98052552f1","version":"2.1.87","gitBranch":"stable","slug":"proud-popping-falcon"}
{"parentUuid":"9acff361-670b-4b4c-8d91-6c95c3356fdf","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"061d3b034125a9ace31d1c63712a509b","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`\n**gem5 补丁已提交** ✅\n- 提交: `63e0b5bf86` \n- 推送到: `origin/stable`\n\n**当前待解决问题:**\n1. ELF 缺少退出处理 (RET 到无效地址)\n2. 生成 2000 个 Microprobe 测试用例\n3. 验证指令正确性和 gem5 仿真\n`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`\n\n正在解决剩余 gem5 问题并生成测试用例...\n"}],"model":"MiniMax-M2.5","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":145632,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0},"service_tier":"standard"},"type":"assistant","uuid":"2ba7a2fb-9d05-4038-a8da-a2c52ce962f3","timestamp":"2026-04-02T06:09:28.852Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/wangxu/1-project/sdc-fuzzing/gem5","sessionId":"d910793e-44d5-4b76-a978-fb98052552f1","version":"2.1.87","gitBranch":"stable","slug":"proud-popping-falcon"}
{"parentUuid":"2ba7a2fb-9d05-4038-a8da-a2c52ce962f3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"061d3b034125a9ace31d1c63712a509b","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_function_xp5a8equr311_1","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"Fix gem5 exit and generate tests","prompt":"FIX GEM5 ISSUES AND GENERATE 2000 TEST CASES\n\n## 当前问题\n1. **ELF 退出问题**: 测试 ELF 执行 RET 指令后跳转到无效地址 0x0 或 0x400000000\n2. **需要生成测试用例**: 使用 Microprobe 生成 2000 个 ARM64 指令流\n\n## 任务 1: 修复 gem5 退出问题\n在 `sdc_baremetal_se.py` 中添加退出处理:\n- 检测程序执行完毕 (PC 回到入口或超出范围)\n- 添加 `wfi` (Wait For Interrupt) 或死循环指令\n- 或修改配置让 gem5 正常退出\n\n## 任务 2: 生成测试用例\n使用 Microprobe SDC fuzzing policy 生成 2000 个测试用例:\n1. 检查 Microprobe 是否已安装\n2. 运行生成命令生成测试用例\n3. 将生成的 ELF 保存到测试目录\n4. 记录每个测试用例的元数据 (指令类型, ACE/IBR 分数等)\n\n## 关键文件\n- gem5: `/Users/wangxu/1-project/sdc-fuzzing/gem5/`\n- Microprobe: `/Users/wangxu/1-project/sdc-fuzzing/microprobe/`\n- Policy: `microprobe/targets/arm64/policies/sdc_fuzzing_policy.py`\n- 测试输出: `/Users/wangxu/1-project/sdc-fuzzing/test_cases/`\n\n## 验证\n每个测试用例需要验证:\n1. QEMU 能正确执行\n2. gem5 SE 能正确执行\n3. 指令正确解码 (无 \"unknown instruction\" 错误)\n4. 寄存器状态哈希匹配\n\n请修复退出问题并生成测试用例。","subagent_type":"oh-my-claudecode:executor"}}],"model":"MiniMax-M2.5","stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":292,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":160384,"output_tokens":591,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"service_tier":"standard"},"type":"assistant","uuid":"d998b426-953c-410b-8e74-af26f000b714","timestamp":"2026-04-02T06:09:29.218Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/wangxu/1-project/sdc-fuzzing/gem5","sessionId":"d910793e-44d5-4b76-a978-fb98052552f1","version":"2.1.87","gitBranch":"stable","slug":"proud-popping-falcon"}
